<section id="glyphs">
  <h2>Glyphs</h2>
  <p class="muted">Hover for the reasoning.</p>
  <div class="glyph-grid mono">
    <span class="glyph-cell" title="Tall, slashed — never an O">0</span>
    <span class="glyph-cell" title="No base serif — never an l">1</span>
    <span class="glyph-cell" title="Two circles, geometric">8</span>
    <span class="glyph-cell" title="Crossing tail">Q</span>
    <span class="glyph-cell" title="Standing leg, serifless">R</span>
    <span class="glyph-cell" title="Bilateral inward serifs">C</span>
    <span class="glyph-cell" title="Hooked inward serif">G</span>
    <span class="glyph-cell" title="Curly, serifless">W</span>
    <span class="glyph-cell" title="Serifed — never a 1 or l">i</span>
    <span class="glyph-cell" title="Serifed — never a 1 or I">l</span>
    <span class="glyph-cell" title="Flat hook">t</span>
    <span class="glyph-cell" title="Flat hook, serifless">f</span>
    <span class="glyph-cell" title="Motion serifs">x</span>
    <span class="glyph-cell" title="Curly, serifless">k</span>
    <span class="glyph-cell" title="Fourfold">@</span>
    <span class="glyph-cell" title="Penta, mid-height">*</span>
    <span class="glyph-cell" title="Rings with segmented slash">%</span>
    <span class="glyph-cell" title="Upper-open">&amp;</span>
    <span class="glyph-cell" title="Flat arc">( )</span>
    <span class="glyph-cell" title="Corner question">?</span>
  </div>

  <h3>Pangrams</h3>
  <div class="preview-box mono">The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog.
Sphinx of black quartz, judge my vow.
Pack my box with five dozen liquor jugs.
<em>How vexingly quick daft zebras jump!</em>
0123456789 oO0 iIlL1 g9qCGQ ~-+=&gt;</div>

